My understanding is that the "by standard" places are manri, and that we
don't really know what a manri is except that they are not concrete. An
ideal solution would be that manri are ka, functions that say whether the
se manri apply. This is clumsy in practice, however; for example I can't
come up with a practical fenki2 of this type.

mi'e la latro'a mu'o

